<title>解读丨全系上自研电池，理想要干什么？</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/transportation/glDqTmPAjocSjhzo.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" data-mpa-action-id="mqyzfe8e1o6q" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="2"><section data-mpa-template="t" data-nest-level="3"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mqyujg2k1kai" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="4"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr1sh6ji1dny" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="5"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" data-mpa-action-id="mqyyysh4f7z" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="6"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;" data-mpa-action-id="mlf0mwjx1fmf" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="7"><section data-role="outer" label="Powered by 135editor.com" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="8"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-top: 15px;margin-bottom: 5px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="9"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-top: 15px;margin-bottom: 15px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="10"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-right: 8px;padding-left: 8px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.7;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="11"><section style="text-align: center;" data-mpa-action-id="mtr3c6k01dra" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="12" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e66880e.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5125" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1280" height="759" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;height: auto !important;" width="1079" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cCyjje3LibqUK1bY1AaMVB2Bt2hm6cbyHPIA3iau2vCMOC1X08ZuPe7e9aNYJHShGtrbeaCaRJmvXkkYfVZyo9CiaUzvkPPdSbxhZDClfluLwo/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx2="562" data-cropsely2="482" data-imgfileid="100102770" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e66880e.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="8"><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="9"><section data-pm-slice="3 4 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="10"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mc47wtwy1gqi" data-nest-level="11"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="12"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;width: 100%;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="13"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;grid-column-gap: 3px;align-self: flex-start;margin-bottom: -8px;background: #fff;padding-right: 6px;z-index: 1;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section><section style="border-top: 1px solid #23648B;border-bottom: 1px solid #23648B;width: 100%;padding: 14px 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="background: #F3F3F3;padding: 12px;width: 100%;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><p yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text" style="font-size: 14px;color: #2C2C2C;line-height: 24px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">理想要把自研从从一项研发能力，变成一套更稳定的产业能力。</span></p></section></section><section style="display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;grid-column-gap: 3px;align-self: flex-end;margin-top: -8px;background: #fff;padding-left: 6px;z-index: 1;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-pm-slice="2 2 []" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;text-align: right;line-height: 1.6em;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="11"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrtqb4vv6w" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;font-size: 14px;" data-nest-level="12"><br/></span></section><section data-pm-slice="2 2 []" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;text-align: right;line-height: 1.6em;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="11"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrtqb4vv6w" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;font-size: 14px;" data-nest-level="12"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">作者 | 王瑞昊</span></span></section><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;text-align: right;line-height: 1.6em;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="11"><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="12"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrtqb4v1pug" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;font-size: 14px;" data-nest-level="13"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">编辑 | 李雨晨</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="6"><span leaf="" data-nest-level="7"><br/></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-nest-level="6"><span mpa-font-style="mr1sgj1g1h96" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" data-nest-level="7"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;" mpa-font-style="mr1sh3ce1sug" data-nest-level="8"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mr1sh6j4ztq" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" data-nest-level="9"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">9月7日15点，理想汽车给新一代MEGA用户划出了一条时间线。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在这个时间点之前锁单的用户，首批车辆仍采用宁德时代5C三元锂电池；15点之后锁单的用户，则将进入搭载理想自研5C三元锂电池的交付批次，预计11月开始交付。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">就在三天前，理想汽车刚刚宣布了一笔26.5亿元的投资。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">9月4日，北京理想汽车有限公司拟以现金方式向欣旺达动力增资26.5亿元。交易完成后，北京理想汽车将直接持有欣旺达动力8.79%的股份。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">叠加此前通过重庆车之辕创业投资有限公司持有的2.60%股份，理想体系最终将通过相关主体合计持有欣旺达动力约11.17%的股份，成为欣旺达的第二大股东。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这笔交易的参考投前估值为274.848亿元，定价与欣旺达动力此前C轮增资保持一致。而理想选择在这个时间点增资，公告里也写明了理由：深化双方在技术研发、产能配套、市场拓展等方面的协同优势。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">增资动作释放的同时，理想正在将自研电池从少数车型，推向全系车型。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">目前，理想自研电池已经搭载在新款理想L8、L6和i8上；今年第四季度，新一代理想MEGA、全新理想i9以及2026款理想i6，也将陆续进入自研电池时代。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这两件事都共同指向了理想长期以来的一个目标，把自研从从一项研发能力，变成一套更稳定的产业能力。</span></span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mtr3f5rl149w"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mce8ut5v1r0s" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-self: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-weight: bold;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(53, 125, 186);line-height: 15px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid=""><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mbrs0ibk1ngb" style="font-size: 20px;" data-mpa-action-id="mbrs0ibwh57" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-is-content="t">PART 1</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;z-index: 1;margin: 0 0 -9px -1px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e685cb5.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e685cb5.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="align-self: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx76d4ei" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;align-items: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);height: 6px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx75dfbf" style="font-size: 28px;"><br/></span></section></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;padding: 3px 14px 8px;font-size: 12px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" mpa-font-style="mbrry8gb6us" data-mpa-action-id="mbrry8hb219o" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="padding: 0px 5px;border-bottom: 7px solid rgb(53, 125, 186);margin-bottom: 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mocw37w6swn" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 17px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vrbsw"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">理想自研电池</span></span></span><h2 style="text-align: justify;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vr1oql"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">真正要摆脱的是标品思维</span></span></span><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h2></section></section></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin: -10px -4px 0 0;align-self: flex-end;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e6a377e.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e6a377e.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">很多人第一次听到理想自研电池，容易产生一个疑问：既然宁德时代、欣旺达这样的电池企业已经把电芯做到如此成熟，理想为什么还要自己做？</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想给出的答案其实很明确：因为它要的从来就不是一块普通电池。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想汽车成立之初，就已经组建了电池研发团队。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2015年，理想曾经开发SEV车型。当时这款车的电池系统就是完全自研自制，团队围绕舱内可便携的电池布置，自研了多版Pack方案。虽然SEV最终因为战略调整被取消，但电池研发团队被保留下来。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">真正让理想把电池研发推向更深层的，是增程路线。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2015年前后，行业还没有真正适合增程车型的高功率+大电量电池。理想选择增程路线，本质上也意味着必须面对一个问题：在有限的电池空间里，既要足够大的电量，又要足够高的功率性能。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想ONE最终选择与宁德时代联合开发，并在2019年推出行业首款增程大电池。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">到了第二代增程车型，理想开始同时推进联合开发与自研两条路线。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2018年，理想提出4C超充目标；2019年组建全栈自研团队，正式启动超充电池研发；2020年，5C超充电池立项，同时开始电芯自主研发。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mtr3i1485j4" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="margin-bottom: 24px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e704c94.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5703703703703704" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;border-radius: 30px;" data-width="1080" data-height="616" data-backw="578" data-backh="330" data-imgfileid="100102779" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e704c94.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这条路线后来逐渐变得清晰。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想不是为了成为一家电池公司，它希望掌握电池最核心的产品定义能力。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想汽车整车电动研发高级副总裁刘立国此前告诉雷峰网《新智驾》，电池并不是一个可以简单采购、装车的标准件。它需要和整车的底盘、车身、热管理、充电系统以及软件算法共同开发，只有这样，才能真正满足用户对续航、补能速度和安全性的需求。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在理想看来，电池不是一个买回来、装上车就结束的标准件。它和底盘、车身、热管理、充电网络以及软件算法之间存在高度耦合。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">因此，理想的电池研发一路从材料体系、电芯结构延伸到Pack、BMS，再与整车进行集成。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也是为什么理想一直强调非标品。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">刘立国此前直言，如果只是为了成本，直接购买市场上的标准电池反而最省事。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">问题在于，理想想解决的是用户真实的补能焦虑。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">比如5C超充。2020年理想立项5C电池时，行业主流方案还集中在2C左右，市场上并不存在成熟的5C解决方案。理想需要同时解决充电倍率、能量密度、寿命、安全以及热管理等问题。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想汽车动力电池高级总监柳志民此前告诉雷峰网《新智驾》，5C电池并不是简单地把充电电流提高几倍，而是要同时解决电芯材料、极片设计、热管理、结构安全和寿命衰减等一系列问题。任何一个环节没有做好，都可能影响整车的安全性和长期使用体验。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">最终，经过多年研发，理想在2024年实现5C高密度超充电池量产。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">更重要的是，这套思路没有停留在纯电车型。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">全新理想L8搭载的自研5C电池，做到72.7kWh电量和430km纯电续航，同时支持峰值5C超充，10分钟充至80%。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">对于一台增程SUV来说，这背后的意义并不只是充电更快。理想实际上是在尝试把增程车的纯电体验继续往前推。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">柳志民告诉雷峰网《新智驾》，增程车型的电池并不能简单照搬纯电车型方案。它既要满足日常纯电行驶的能量需求，也要适应发动机介入、频繁充放电和高功率输出等复杂工况。因此，增程电池在功率、寿命、热管理和SOC估算方面，都有自己的技术难点。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">同样的逻辑也体现在磷酸铁锂电池上。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">过去行业长期认为铁锂不适合增程，核心难点之一就是SOC估算。理想通过自研ATR算法，试图解决铁锂中段电压平缓带来的电量估算问题，让铁锂在增程车型上的应用成为可能。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">所以从理想ONE的增程大电池，到5C超充，再到铁锂增程，理想这11年的电池研发其实一直在做同一件事：不接受市场现成的答案，自己围绕整车和用户需求重新定义答案。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也解释了理想为什么没有选择100%自己造。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想自己也承认，电池产业已经拥有成熟的制造体系。与其把大量资源投入到电芯工厂、设备和产线，不如把研发资源集中到真正能够形成产品差异化的部分。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">因此，理想最终形成了一套很有意思的模式：核心技术自己定义，电芯可以合作开发、代工，Pack则可以自制或通过合资体系制造。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想负责设计这块电池是什么，产业伙伴负责把它稳定、规模化地造出来。这也为下一步增资欣旺达埋下了伏笔。</span></span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mtr3gbxrx95"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mce8ut5v1r0s" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-self: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-weight: bold;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(53, 125, 186);line-height: 15px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid=""><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mbrs0ibk1ngb" style="font-size: 20px;" data-mpa-action-id="mbrs0ibwh57" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-is-content="t">PART 2</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;z-index: 1;margin: 0 0 -9px -1px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e72221e.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e72221e.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="align-self: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx76d4ei" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;align-items: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);height: 6px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx75dfbf" style="font-size: 28px;"><br/></span></section></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;padding: 3px 14px 8px;font-size: 12px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" mpa-font-style="mbrry8gb6us" data-mpa-action-id="mbrry8hb219o" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="padding: 0px 5px;border-bottom: 7px solid rgb(53, 125, 186);margin-bottom: 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mocw37w6swn" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 17px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vrbsw"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">理想和欣旺达</span></span></span><h2 style="text-align: justify;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vr1oql"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">合作了近6年 现在才走到绑定</span></span></span><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h2></section></section></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin: -10px -4px 0 0;align-self: flex-end;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e740968.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e740968.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想与欣旺达的关系，也并非从这26.5亿元开始。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">按照理想方面的说法，双方已经进行了将近6年的深度合作。过去几年里，欣旺达承担的一个重要角色，就是帮助理想把自研电池技术真正落到量产。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这里需要厘清一个容易被误解的问题：理想自研电池，并不等于欣旺达替理想贴牌造电池。双方的分工更接近于理想定义产品，欣旺达完成工程化制造。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想负责产品定义，从电芯层面的材料配方、结构体系，到Pack、BMS等底层开发，都由理想主导；欣旺达则利用自身在电芯制造、工程化和供应链上的能力，把理想的技术方案变成可以大规模交付的产品。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">刘立国告诉雷峰网《新智驾》，理想自研的核心并不是把所有制造环节都搬回自己手里，而是掌握电池产品的定义权和关键技术。对于电芯制造这样的重资产环节，理想更看重合作伙伴能否把研发方案稳定地转化为量产产品。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这种合作其实非常符合双方的能力边界。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想更懂整车。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">它知道用户需要什么样的续航、什么样的充电速度，也知道电池应该如何与底盘、车身、热管理和整车软件协同。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">欣旺达更懂电池制造。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">尤其是在高倍率电池领域，欣旺达长期积累了HEV电池技术经验。HEV电池本身就需要面对高频充放电、高功率输出等工况，这与理想早期推进5C超充的技术方向存在较强的契合。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">柳志民则表示，欣旺达在高功率电池、制造工艺和量产爬坡方面积累了较深经验，这种能力对于理想自研电池尤其重要。理想需要的不是一个只负责代工的工厂，而是能够参与工程化、共同解决量产问题的制造伙伴。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想方面还特别提到，欣旺达拥有服务苹果、特斯拉、小米等头部客户的经验。这意味着欣旺达能够提供的不只是产能，还有高标准制造、质量管理、供应链协同以及大规模交付能力。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这对于理想尤其重要。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想自研电池真正带来的变化，在于这套技术正在从实验室走向量产，未来将有越来越多的理想汽车搭载这套技术。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">今年第四季度就是一个明显的节点。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">新一代MEGA将从宁德时代5C三元锂电池切换到理想自研5C三元锂电池；全新i9首批也将使用宁德时代5C三元锂电池，待理想自研电池完成生产爬坡后切换；2026款i6则直接搭载理想自研5C电池。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mtr3hsc4erd" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="margin-bottom: 24px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e78524d.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6934984520123839" data-type="png" data-w="969" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;border-radius: 30px;" data-width="969" data-height="672" data-backw="578" data-backh="401" data-imgfileid="100102777" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e78524d.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">当自研电池从少量产品验证进入全系产品铺开，制造端的确定性开始变得越来越重要。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这时候，理想需要的已经不只是一个供应商。它需要一个能够跟着自己的技术路线一起迭代、能够承接非标电池、能够保证质量并且拥有规模化制造能力的产业伙伴。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">而欣旺达恰好具备这些条件。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">所以，双方关系的变化其实可以看成三个阶段。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">最初，是供应商关系；然后，是联合开发关系；现在，则开始进入战略绑定关系。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想给欣旺达的，同样不只是资金。作为整车企业，理想可以提供持续的产品需求、明确的技术路线以及真实的整车应用场景。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">换句话说，欣旺达可以从理想这里获得一个稳定而长期的客户，同时参与下一代高倍率、高安全、长寿命电池的技术开发。</span></span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mtr3h557zau"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mce8ut5v1r0s" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-self: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-weight: bold;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(53, 125, 186);line-height: 15px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid=""><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mbrs0ibk1ngb" style="font-size: 20px;" data-mpa-action-id="mbrs0ibwh57" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-is-content="t">PART 3</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;z-index: 1;margin: 0 0 -9px -1px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e7a55e1.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e7a55e1.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="align-self: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx76d4ei" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;align-items: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);height: 6px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx75dfbf" style="font-size: 28px;"><br/></span></section></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;padding: 3px 14px 8px;font-size: 12px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" mpa-font-style="mbrry8gb6us" data-mpa-action-id="mbrry8hb219o" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="padding: 0px 5px;border-bottom: 7px solid rgb(53, 125, 186);margin-bottom: 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mocw37w6swn" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 17px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vrbsw"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">26.5亿元真正买的</span></span></span><h2 style="text-align: justify;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vr1oql"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">是电池研发到量产之间的确定性</span></span></span><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h2></section></section></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin: -10px -4px 0 0;align-self: flex-end;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e7c26e4.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e7c26e4.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">多位投资人向雷峰网《新智驾》表示，这次增资动作有藏着最重要的一个关键词是，确定性。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想此次增资完成后，直接持有欣旺达动力8.79%的股份，加上此前持有的2.60%，理想相关主体合计持股约11.17%，是目前欣旺达的第二大股东。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这个比例并不意味着理想要控制欣旺达动力。现阶段，理想仍然会保留多元供应链策略。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想此前已经明确，自研与外采并非二选一。宁德时代依然是重要合作伙伴，欣旺达也是重要合作伙伴，自研则负责解决市场标准产品解决不了的问题。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">所以这笔投资的意义，更接近于把原来的项目合作变成了一种更长期的利益绑定。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想看中的，首先是研发确定性。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想的电池越来越非标，意味着每一代产品都需要重新定义电芯、Pack、BMS以及整车集成方案。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">战略投资之后，双方可以把下一代产品的研发需求更早地导入制造端。研发团队不需要等产品定义完成之后，再去寻找产线和制造方案，而是可以在研发阶段就同步考虑工程化。对于5C、高能量密度、长寿命这样的电池而言，这种前置协同非常重要。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mtr3hjwx1llc" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="margin-bottom: 24px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e7ed422.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.75" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1280" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;border-radius: 30px;" data-width="1280" data-height="960" data-backw="578" data-backh="434" data-imgfileid="100102778" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f6e7ed422.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">刘立国说，电池研发和制造不能被割裂开来。越是高倍率、高能量密度的电池，越需要在设计阶段就考虑制造工艺、设备能力和质量控制。如果研发完成后再把方案交给供应商，往往会增加量产爬坡的难度。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">还有质量的确定性。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想一直强调，谁生产并不是用户真正需要关注的问题。因为最终面对用户承担性能、安全、寿命和售后责任的，始终是理想。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想目前对自研电池提出了非常高的质量要求，从电芯到Pack设置大量质量控制点，并将制造数据纳入自身体系。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">战略投资的价值，在于让理想能够更深入地参与制造工艺、质量标准、问题改善和技术迭代。换句话说，理想不是把质量控制交给欣旺达，而是试图把自己的质量要求更深地嵌入欣旺达的制造体系。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">柳志民向雷峰网《新智驾》表示，电池质量不是靠某一个检测环节保证的，而是要贯穿材料、电芯、模组、Pack和整车验证的全过程。理想会把整车端的使用场景和质量要求前置到电池开发与制造环节中，确保电池在实验室性能之外，也能经受长期真实使用。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">此外是产能和交付的确定性。这一点可能是这次投资最现实的价值。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">当理想自研电池开始进入MEGA、i9、i6等更多车型，电池需求规模会持续扩大。而理想又坚持非标路线，电芯并不能简单地与其他客户共享标准产线。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">刘立国此前解释过，只有采用相同尺寸、相同规格的标准电芯，才更容易实现共线生产。理想自己的电芯由于规格和性能要求不同，很多情况下需要专线生产。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">所以，理想增资欣旺达的阳谋，其实已经非常清楚了：理想负责把电池做到非标、做到领先，欣旺达负责把这套非标技术稳定地造出来；理想需要欣旺达的制造能力，欣旺达也需要理想这样的长期战略客户。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
<category>智能驾驶</category>
<comments>https://www.leiphone.com/category/transportation/glDqTmPAjocSjhzo.html#comments</comments>
<pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:28:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>45分钟小定8000台，智己LS6这次成了？</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/transportation/ZbUAuIZ3oSpuD906.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" data-mpa-action-id="mqyzfe8e1o6q" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="2"><section data-mpa-template="t" data-nest-level="3"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mqyujg2k1kai" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="4"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr1sh6ji1dny" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="5"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" data-mpa-action-id="mqyyysh4f7z" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="6"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;" data-mpa-action-id="mlf0mwjx1fmf" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="7"><section data-role="outer" label="Powered by 135editor.com" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="8"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-top: 15px;margin-bottom: 5px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="9"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-top: 15px;margin-bottom: 15px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="10"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-right: 8px;padding-left: 8px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.7;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="11"><section style="text-align: center;" data-mpa-action-id="mu0noxb6p2k" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="12" nodeleaf=""><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/cCyjje3LibqX5qySYoOWVzicAibjE42h6UaW7EL2x3M7QyMYu3tt90d5nRul4VYADvCjMLYEwhs5eVico4JHzBnCHlkOn4TwRBwG44AvKyLlALM/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx2="562" data-cropsely2="375" data-imgfileid="100102854" data-ratio="0.66640625" data-s="300,640" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67ab7ff2.jpg" data-type="png" data-w="1280" height="930" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;height: auto !important;" width="1079"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67ab7ff2.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="8"><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="9"><section data-pm-slice="3 4 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="10"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mc47wtwy1gqi" data-nest-level="11"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="12"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;width: 100%;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="13"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;grid-column-gap: 3px;align-self: flex-start;margin-bottom: -8px;background: #fff;padding-right: 6px;z-index: 1;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section><section style="border-top: 1px solid #23648B;border-bottom: 1px solid #23648B;width: 100%;padding: 14px 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="background: #F3F3F3;padding: 12px;width: 100%;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><p yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text" style="font-size: 14px;color: #2C2C2C;line-height: 24px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">这一次，智己能走出</span><span leaf="">「</span><span leaf="">叫好不叫座</span><span leaf="">」</span><span leaf="">吗？</span></p></section></section><section style="display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;grid-column-gap: 3px;align-self: flex-end;margin-top: -8px;background: #fff;padding-left: 6px;z-index: 1;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="14"><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="width: 6px;height: 14px;background: #23648B;clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 20% 100%);" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="15"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-pm-slice="2 2 []" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;text-align: right;line-height: 1.6em;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="11"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrtqb4vv6w" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;font-size: 14px;" data-nest-level="12"><br/></span></section><section data-pm-slice="2 2 []" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;text-align: right;line-height: 1.6em;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="11"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrtqb4vv6w" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;font-size: 14px;" data-nest-level="12"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">作者 | 王瑞昊</span></span></section><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;text-align: right;line-height: 1.6em;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="11"><section style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-nest-level="12"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrtqb4v1pug" style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;word-break: normal !important;font-size: 14px;" data-nest-level="13"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">编辑 | 李雨晨</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="6"><span leaf="" data-nest-level="7"><br/></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-nest-level="6"><span mpa-font-style="mr1sgj1g1h96" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" data-nest-level="7"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;" mpa-font-style="mr1sh3ce1sug" data-nest-level="8"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mr1sh6j4ztq" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" data-nest-level="9"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">9月10日，全新一代智己LS6正式开启预售，预售价20.99万元起，并将于9月23日正式上市。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">预售开启45分钟，小订突破8000台。</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这是智己“Next·2028战略”下的首款20万级纯电SUV，也是LS6迭代到第四代的产品。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">LS6一直是智己的当家花旦。但对这家成立近六年的品牌来说，智己身上始终贴着一个不算好听的标签：技术很好，但叫好不叫座。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在智己眼中，全新一代LS6是全线控大五座家庭SUV，把上汽70年的造车积淀，以9系的旗舰标准，放进一台20万级的家庭SUV里。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">三大下一代技术是这台车的核心：下一代全线控灵蜥底盘、下一代NEO三电架构、下一代全域物理AI智能。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">智己汽车副总经理徐崟将其概括为“三大硬核科技”。他在预售发布会后的沟通会中反复强调的一句话是：上汽集团把最好的技术，都放在了这台车上。</span></span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mu0og32qmdw"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mce8ut5v1r0s" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-self: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-weight: bold;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(53, 125, 186);line-height: 15px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid=""><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mbrs0ibk1ngb" style="font-size: 20px;" data-mpa-action-id="mbrs0ibwh57" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-is-content="t">PART 1</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;z-index: 1;margin: 0 0 -9px -1px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67ad7b88.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67ad7b88.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="align-self: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx76d4ei" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;align-items: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);height: 6px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx75dfbf" style="font-size: 28px;"><br/></span></section></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;padding: 3px 14px 8px;font-size: 12px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" mpa-font-style="mbrry8gb6us" data-mpa-action-id="mbrry8hb219o" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="padding: 0px 5px;border-bottom: 7px solid rgb(53, 125, 186);margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mocw37w6swn" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 17px;word-break: break-word;" data-mid="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vrbsw"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">产品：把航空级线控</span></span></span><h2 style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vr1oql"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">下放到20万级</span></span></span><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h2></section></section></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin: -10px -4px 0 0;align-self: flex-end;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67b0250b.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67b0250b.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">全新一代智己LS6发布前后，外界讨论最多的一个概念是A320。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">把一台家用SUV和空客A320放在一起，最初看起来更像一句营销话术。但在智己的解释里，这其实指向的是同一个技术源头——线控。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">徐崟告诉雷峰网《新智驾》，空客之所以一直在用线控，核心原因是线控技术的安全性，而安全恰恰是航空领域最看重的那件事。落到一台家庭SUV上，最看重的同样是家庭安全，线控技术增加的是安全的保险系数。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这套系统具备航空级三重安全冗余设计，20毫秒级的响应速度比传统转向快4倍</span></span><strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在遇到突发状况时，系统会辅助用户进行刹车和避让，比人的反应更快、也更稳定。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">为了让这套能力被看见，智己在发布会上做了一次被内部称为“安全五联考”的实测。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">智己高性能运动部魏鹏达分享了测试的全过程：在六个横风模拟风扇、20多米的区间内，同时叠加暴雨、横风、卡车撞击，撞击过程中斜着爆胎，爆胎之后马上再丢出一个障碍物箱体——五个项目在同一区间内一次性完成。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“这五个项目是在六个风扇区间内同时完成的，是五重叠加的暴击。”按照魏鹏达的说法，这类场景在现实中属于小概率极端工况，日常开车也许只会遇到其中一两个，但五重叠加之下，车辆依然稳定保持在原车道内并安全停下。他特别强调了一段细节：这段视频不是AI生成的，而是真实拍摄。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">徐崟对这套技术的概括更直接：“安全不是碰撞出来的，我希望在事故发生之前，大家就能提前避免。”他把它称为“失控前的安全”。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mu0o0wxr19m7" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67b5bead.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.5" data-type="png" data-w="836" height="855" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;border-radius: 30px;" width="798" data-width="836" data-height="1254" data-backw="578" data-backh="867" data-imgfileid="100102865" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67b5bead.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 12px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mu0o0jxfou2" data-mpa-action-id="mu0o0jxl221z" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;color: #888888;">智己副总经理徐崟</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">安全之外，全线控底盘带来了几个此前很难在这个级别看到的能力：4.49米超小转弯半径，半圈打满、一把掉头；行业唯一的转向比三档可调，可以根据驾驶习惯在灵敏、正常、轻松之间切换。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">徐崟在群访中直言，熟悉这个行业的人应该知道，目前没有什么品牌真正全系标配这项技术，尤其是下放到20万级的。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也是“Next·2028战略”最容易被感知的那一部分。按照徐崟的说法，这项技术的研究早在两三年前就已启动，从LS9开始逐步把同一套系统往下放，经过L6，最终落到LS6上。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“我们这么做的目的在于：第一，让我们的消费者拿到真正的技术；第二，我们想拿出最大的诚意给到消费者，同时也是给到这个市场。”徐崟说。</span></span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mu0ofp7v1f2s"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mce8ut5v1r0s" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-self: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-weight: bold;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(53, 125, 186);line-height: 15px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid=""><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mbrs0ibk1ngb" style="font-size: 20px;" data-mpa-action-id="mbrs0ibwh57" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-is-content="t">PART 2</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;z-index: 1;margin: 0 0 -9px -1px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67b8300a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67b8300a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="align-self: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx76d4ei" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;align-items: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);height: 6px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx75dfbf" style="font-size: 28px;"><br/></span></section></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;padding: 3px 14px 8px;font-size: 12px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" mpa-font-style="mbrry8gb6us" data-mpa-action-id="mbrry8hb219o" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="padding: 0px 5px;border-bottom: 7px solid rgb(53, 125, 186);margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mocw37w6swn" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 17px;word-break: break-word;" data-mid="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vrbsw"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">三电：12.7度电背后</span></span></span><h2 style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vr1oql"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">是0.2毫米</span></span></span><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h2></section></section></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin: -10px -4px 0 0;align-self: flex-end;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67b9f33a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67b9f33a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">纯电SUV最容易被拿来做比较的，永远是能耗。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">全新一代智己LS6能耗达12.7kWh/100km，后驱大电池版本CLTC续航782公里。智己说，这个数字不是靠把电池背大换来的。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">项娇向雷峰网《新智驾》解释了背后的逻辑：电池越大，重量也越大，不但不一定带来能耗优势，还可能影响操控和安全。智己追求的是更低的能耗，而不是更大的电池。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这个背后，是一个看起来不太起眼的零件——0.2毫米硅钢片。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">徐崟在群访中花了不少时间讲这件事：把硅钢片做到0.2毫米这么薄，才让电机效率提升了2.8%，重量降低了8%。“大家看这个数字好像不太大，但本身这个电机已经非常优秀，在优秀基础上再提升很不容易。”</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">配合最新的NEO飓风电机、NEO后驱和双层油冷等硬件，以及IM ECU Master全新能效大师管理系统3.0，整车的能量管理被统一管了起来，空调、驱动、能量回收统一调度。一个细节是，车上的低压电耗从600多瓦降到了200多瓦，降了三分之二。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">补能是另一条线。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">全新一代智己LS6基于全域800V高压平台，最高充电功率396kW，15分钟补能500公里。但项娇强调的不是峰值数字，而是可达性。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“很多友商发布了超充，片面追求单点功率最大，但往往这些功率只有在特殊桩上才能实现。我们提供给大家的超快充，90%快充桩都可以达到这个桩的满充功率。”</span></span></p><section nodeleaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mu0o464d5wd" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67c3de4b.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.4859154929577465" data-type="png" data-w="1136" height="1071" style="background-color:transparent;border-radius:30px;width:100%;" width="1136" data-width="1136" data-height="1688" data-backw="578" data-backh="545" data-imgfileid="100102863" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67c3de4b.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 12px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mu0o4apn1k99" data-mpa-action-id="mu0o4apt19so" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;color: #888888;">智己CTO项娇</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">冬季表现也被单独拿出来讲。影响冬夏能耗最多的是热管理系统，这次车上搭载了全新一代热管理系统和十通阀集成管理系统。相比上一代产品，冬季和夏季能耗减少了10%到15%；在维持舒适温度的前提下，无论冬夏，每小时能耗可以降到0.5度电以下。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">电池部分搭载宁德时代93度电池，可靠性达到PPB航空级，配备极速切断装置，监测到风险可毫秒级断电。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在成本的取舍上，项娇的表态很硬：“我们不会在看不到的地方减成本。恰恰这些看不到的地方，比如底盘、NOH，对用户的安全、操控是最负责任的。”</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">他的理由是两点：上汽70年造车底蕴支撑了完全自研，没有研发黑盒的额外代价；上汽有完善可靠的供应链，所以“大家看不到、但对大家最重要的部分，我们一点不做取舍”。</span></span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mu0oa9xvekr"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mce8ut5v1r0s" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-self: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-weight: bold;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(53, 125, 186);line-height: 15px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid=""><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mbrs0ibk1ngb" style="font-size: 20px;" data-mpa-action-id="mbrs0ibwh57" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-is-content="t">PART 3</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;z-index: 1;margin: 0 0 -9px -1px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67c68e2c.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67c68e2c.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="align-self: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx76d4ei" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;align-items: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);height: 6px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx75dfbf" style="font-size: 28px;"><br/></span></section></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;padding: 3px 14px 8px;font-size: 12px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" mpa-font-style="mbrry8gb6us" data-mpa-action-id="mbrry8hb219o" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="padding: 0px 5px;border-bottom: 7px solid rgb(53, 125, 186);margin-bottom: 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mocw37w6swn" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 17px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vrbsw"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">AI：能开车，也能办事</span></span></span></section></section></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin: -10px -4px 0 0;align-self: flex-end;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67c87b2b.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67c87b2b.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">如果说底盘和三电是这台车的身体，那么智能化是智己这次最想讲的新故事。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">智舱层面，全新一代智己LS6行业首发IM Claw龙虾智能体。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">项娇把它和市面上常见语音助手的区别概括为两点：第一，从单点、指令式的对答，做到对人意图的理解；第二，从原来的单项指令直接执行，变成多模块、多任务的连续执行。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">他举了两个例子。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">什么是指令性问答？以往语音唤醒后，需要给一个明确指令——“把空调温度调到23度”“导航到某地”。而IM Claw要做的，是理解“我有点冷”这种模糊表达，然后把车内调整到让人舒服的温度。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">第二个例子是家庭出行场景：一句“几点几分回家”，中间夹着多目的地导航、行程规划、点餐等一系列需求，智能体可以从意图理解延伸到多任务分析，最终一气呵成地执行完。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“我们希望车辆中的AI座舱，从原来被动式的应答，转换成一个主动代劳的角色。”项娇说。她把目标比作贾维斯，并提到未来会直连更丰富的阿里AI生态。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">智驾层面，智己与Momenta的关系被反复提及。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">项娇称，智己是Momenta行业唯一的创始灯塔合作伙伴，双方相互持股、技术共研。从智己品牌初创、Momenta还是一家初创公司时开始，双方就是初始的、创始的合作伙伴。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这次发布会上，双方合作的成果是IM AD ZETA辅助驾驶系统。按照智己的说法，这套系统以L4级模型能力赋能L2功能，全面适配Momenta世界模型。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">对于近期Momenta新模型发布的提问，项娇的回应是：无论是过去、今天还是未来，从智己的角度来讲，和Momenta的合作永远都会拿出市场当中最好的产品，来体现灯塔合作伙伴的价值。</span></span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mu0o6pop1c4h"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mce8ut5v1r0s" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-self: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-weight: bold;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(53, 125, 186);line-height: 15px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid=""><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mbrs0ibk1ngb" style="font-size: 20px;" data-mpa-action-id="mbrs0ibwh57" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" mpa-is-content="t">PART 4</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;z-index: 1;margin: 0 0 -9px -1px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67ca63e4.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67ca63e4.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="align-self: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx76d4ei" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="display: flex;align-items: flex-start;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);height: 6px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-mpa-action-id="mbrrx75dfbf" style="font-size: 28px;"><br/></span></section></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;padding: 3px 14px 8px;font-size: 12px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" mpa-font-style="mbrry8gb6us" data-mpa-action-id="mbrry8hb219o" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="padding: 0px 5px;border-bottom: 7px solid rgb(53, 125, 186);margin-bottom: 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mocw37w6swn" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 17px;word-break: break-word;text-align: center;" data-mid="" yb-mpa-mark="mark-style-text"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p><span mpa-font-style="mocvtjufmjv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 20px;" mpa-font-style="mocw37vrbsw"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t">市场：从叫好，到叫座</span></span></span></section></section></section><section style="width: 14px;height: 13px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin: -10px -4px 0 0;align-self: flex-end;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67cc415c.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9285714285714286" data-w="28" style="background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67cc415c.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">技术之外，智己面对的是一道更现实的题。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">今年20万到30万的大五座SUV市场升温速度极快，理想、特斯拉在这个细分市场都有表现不错的产品</span></span><strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">而更大的背景是：半年内有500多台车上市发布，上半年整体市场却下滑了20%。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">对于竞品，徐崟并不讳言：“友商有几款SUV卖得不错，比如理想、特斯拉有两款纯电车，在这个细分市场表现就很好，产品力都还可以。”回到LS6如何突围，他的答案是三大硬核科技加上一个有诚意的价格。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">徐崟的判断是，消费者会认为你不发布，就说明品牌没有持续推出更新、技术不够领先。“所以你必须在非常卷的市场里，用新的产品、新的技术，来获得消费者的认可。”</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“Next·2028战略”是理解这台车的另一个入口。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">今年成都车展上，智己发布了这一战略，首款落地车型是全新一代智己L6；而全新一代LS6，是这一战略下的第一款20万级纯电SUV。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">徐崟对这项战略的解释，核心落在一个“早”字上，把未来三年的先进技术，提前直接用在今天这款车上。他拿线控举例：这项技术以前用在民航客机上，车上没人用；智己想要的，是让消费者更早体会、体验到最新的技术。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">项娇补充说，现在离2028年已经不太远了，所以工作只争朝夕。智己之所以能在20万这个级别里，快速把这些未来科技带给大家，靠的是上汽集团长时间的积累。在她看来，“Next·2028战略”谈的更多是一种态度——围绕三大硬核科技，不玩虚的，都是在为家庭考虑。</span></span></p><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67d05bc5.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5625" data-type="jpeg" data-w="4000" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="4000" data-height="2250" data-backw="578" data-backh="325" data-imgfileid="100102864" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67d05bc5.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">对于“叫好不叫座”这个绕不开的问题，徐崟给出的答案是两个关键词：技术落地，和情绪价值。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">他常跟团队说要贴近消费者，再夸张一点说，要贴近年轻消费者。这台车上每个座位都要让人坐得舒服，因为车上有小孩、大人、老人。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">落到具体的产品上，是一串可以被直接感知的细节：主驾同级唯一全系标配4D机械按摩座椅，按摩强度达气动按摩的7倍；副驾零重力座椅、贵妃椅、向前折叠三种模式；后排座椅靠背最大131度电动无级调节；全车座椅通风、加热、按摩全部标配，不用加钱、不用选装；丹麦B&amp;O音响同级唯一全系标配；11L双开门冰箱。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">还有一个小细节被徐崟单独拎了出来：前引擎盖下105L的前备箱，拿行李时按一按、敲一敲，引擎盖就自动开启。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“我一直和营销团队强调，我们有很好的技术，但如何让技术落地，落到消费者日常生活中，让消费者感受到技术能给他带来好处和利益，这才是最重要的。”</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">渠道是另一半答案。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">截至上个月，智己在全国有436家门店，平均成交价格在23万元。徐崟透露，新车展车已全面进店，试驾同步开启，商圈店、快闪和慢闪店都配备了展车和试驾车。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">对于网络扩张，他的口径是“优胜劣汰”，核心依据是该区域的市场占有率，如果区域内已经达到合理规模，会评估经销商饱和并暂缓开新店；如果还没达成目标，就可能发展新经销商。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“经销商满意度里面最重要的一块，就是健康可持续的运营。”</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">徐崟说，客户满意度包含两块，一是经销商满意度，二是客户满意度；面对消费者的是经销商伙伴，如果经销商伙伴不满意，客户也不会满意。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">关于产品迭代节奏，徐崟回顾了过往。他有海外工作经历，海外通常一年做一次年款更新、两年完成一次MC中期改款。而LS6自2023年发布至今已经历第四次迭代：第一代全系标配激光雷达，行业第一个；第二代落地灵蜥数字底盘、标配四轮转向；第三代引领大电池超级增程；第四代是今天的全线控底盘。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在价格上，他的表态是要维持相对稳健的价格体系，但技术会不断迭代。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">按照智己的规划，从LS9到L6再到LS6，接下来上汽智己所有车型都会标配线控技术。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">对于这台车最终能不能成，徐崟的判断标准很接地气：“光听我说可能感触不够深，只要一上车摸下方向盘就能感受到。开过一次，比我们嘴上说一百句都更有效率。”</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">全新一代智己LS6将于9月23日正式上市。这是“Next·2028战略”第一次以20万级纯电SUV的形态接受市场检验，也是智己把“技术好”这件事，真正兑换成销量的一次机会。</span></span></p></section><section data-mpa-template="t" data-from="yb-recommend-list" data-mpa-action-id="mu0nqkib1lpm" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" data-from="yb-recommend" data-recommend-article-type="normal" data-recomment-template-id="1" data-recommend-article-id="1000002519_1" data-recommend-article-time="1784630504" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/cCyjje3LibqXnlQVdAIbF8wamdZGe6GWIDNccLiaic4Xm5P9boqPvp2uZiaRlpRbqtHial2TobTuADI8UKWJsWINA0iazVune0WzzQ1BXoXSC5ce4/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="上汽智己，如何成为Momenta第一个抬轿人？" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/X18LfEXBAEX4rt7_Qe0cIg"><section data-recommend-type="normal" data-recommend-tid="1" style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="width: 100%;background: #ffffff;display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid=""><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><span style="width: 100%;flex:1;" class="js_jump_icon h5_image_link"><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==&mid=2247585652&idx=1&sn=c8ed595784c7022207dd354bf1418ee9&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67d3a183.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.42554858934169276" data-w="1276" style="width: 100%;max-height: none;object-fit: cover;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67d3a183.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></span></section><section style="width: 100%;padding: 9px 7px 8px;background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #ffffff;line-height: 18px;margin-top: -35px;z-index: 20;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==&mid=2247585652&idx=1&sn=c8ed595784c7022207dd354bf1418ee9&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #FFFFFF;">上汽智己，如何成为Momenta第一个抬轿人？</span></a></span></p></section></section></section></section><span leaf=""><br/></span><section data-mpa-template="t" data-from="yb-recommend" data-recommend-article-type="normal" data-recomment-template-id="1" data-recommend-article-id="1000002562_1" data-recommend-article-time="1789038263" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cCyjje3LibqWc7lUe2MfZQSOHmbJC4uZOmy7qz2tiaeYNWDiavGqR5v6Xa2SZHFiaLygpCJ9gbaAVcQaAXPUDskuic0205Z402aP05fa4F3BlYdo/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="对话蔚来创始人李斌：蔚来单车均价比奥迪贵18万，比宝马贵七八万，比奔驰贵数万" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wqvcp96QSGLzcvft6e59qQ"><section data-recommend-type="normal" data-recommend-tid="1" style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="width: 100%;background: #ffffff;display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid=""><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><span style="width: 100%;flex:1;" class="js_jump_icon h5_image_link"><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==&mid=2247586494&idx=1&sn=394287d800a34306e87ec88225e4b848&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67d588be.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4258804258804259" data-w="1221" style="width: 100%;max-height: none;object-fit: cover;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9f67d588be.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></span></section><section style="width: 100%;padding: 9px 7px 8px;background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #ffffff;line-height: 18px;margin-top: -35px;z-index: 20;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNjk5NjIzNw==&mid=2247586494&idx=1&sn=394287d800a34306e87ec88225e4b848&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #FFFFFF;">对话蔚来创始人李斌：蔚来单车均价比奥迪贵18万，比宝马贵七八万，比奔驰贵数万</span></a></span></p></section></section></section></section><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr1sh6ji1dny" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-nest-level="5"><section style="text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);" data-pm-slice="9 7 []" data-nest-level="4"><section powered-by="ezDrop" data-wechat="ezDrop" label="ezDrop 微信SVG交互图文排版插件 版权所有" style="ov